sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	actor U as Customer
	participant A as BookAgent
	participant P as Memory context provider
	participant PG as Preferences (PostgreSQL)
	participant Q as Episodes (Qdrant)
	participant C as Background queue
	participant X as Memory worker
	participant R as Privacy filter (Presidio)
	participant L as Chat model

	Note over U,L: Proposed successful flow for a verified customer
	U ->> A: Ask for book recommendations
	A ->> P: Prepare memory for this answer
	P ->> P: Resolve verified customer identity
	P ->> PG: Load only this customer's preferences
	P ->> Q: Find only this customer's relevant, unexpired episodes
	P -->> A: Provide bounded memory, or no block if empty
	A -->> U: Stream answer
	A ->> P: Answer completed
	P ->> C: Submit exchange without waiting for extraction
	C ->> X: Process queued exchange
	X ->> R: Remove identifying text
	R -->> X: Anonymized exchange
	X ->> L: Propose episode and preference candidates
	L -->> X: Candidate memories
	X ->> X: Reject sensitive or unsupported content
	X ->> Q: Save eligible episode with expiry
	X ->> PG: Merge eligible stated preferences
